nts","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Coffee & Tea, Food","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"5JyEHdmTufydVTQsw4afQg","review_id":"OBpgNBUMGdp92YR2Lo488A","date":"2012-05-17T20:01:49","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9181067943572998,"text_excerpt":"This is a franchise store, but the owner is always there and has great customer service. They don't appear to have any turnover, because I go here often, but the same employees are ALWAYS here. (that's good). Creamy cafe-au-lait, not too burnt like the national chains. THe cranberry-orange muffin is my favorite. Bathrooms are clean and there is plenty of quiet seating to enjoy your muffin."},{"business_id":"5JyEHdmTufydVTQsw4afQg","review_id":"BnyGDcBK0CtVAW6g2GBkHA","date":"2012-04-22T18:49:38","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9047841429710388,"text_excerpt":"I've been here over 200 times since they opened. The Iced Coffee is the best. They make some great frozen drinks including the Granita that's fantastic. Eats are average and they have a toaster and microwave for customer's use. The muffins are the best thing going for food here. The service is always quick and precise. If you're coming for a bit, they have free wifi. Please leave at least a buck tip for the hard-working ladies making drinks."},{"business_id":"5JyEHdmTufydVTQsw4afQg","review_id":"wKOf4vXjvOattZJ2N33dKQ","date":"2020-11-19T18:24:54","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9020410776138306,"text_excerpt":"Okay Folks. Theirs some new owners on the block. So i had to give this place another try. Just walking in felt different. I understand that Covid-19 is still going on. So I made sure to wear my mask. I notice right away that everything was socially distance including the on the floor signs. The pastry area was fully stocked and looking delicious. But what shocked me the most was the owners were their helping their employees and greeting the customers as we walked in. I've never seen that done in New Orleans. Im pretty simple when it comes to coffee but this day i actually did one of the holiday drinks and it was very good. Free WiFi is all you had to offer mixed with good customer service..."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
